SUMMARY:Free Cuddle @ the Park/Show\; Hope of OZ
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Cuddle Collective\nthis is a free event but **[pleas
 e register HERE](https://www.zeffy.com/en-US/ticketing/free-cuddle-the-par
 kshow-montfort-players-hope-of-oz)**[ ](https://www.zeffy.com/en-US/ticket
 ing/free-cuddle-the-parkshow-montfort-players-hope-of-oz)so we have a fina
 l head count.\n\nCome cuddle in the park while watching local free (donati
 ons encouraged) theater! The **Montford Players** are preforming **Hope of
  OZ** and you are invited to come watch the show with the Asheville Cuddle
  Collective. Note- we will not be doing icebreakers or connection games. Y
 ou are welcome to ask people to cuddle or share touch and as always\, wait
  for an enthusiastic yes before touching anyone.\n\nShow begins at 7:30- w
 e will gather our blankets and start connecting at 7pm.\n[https://www.expl
 oreasheville.com/asheville/events/hope-oz](https://www.exploreasheville.co
 m/asheville/events/hope-oz)\n\nWhat to bring- Please bring a blanket and p
 illow to help create the cuddle space. Bring your own water & snacks to sh
 are.\nYou are welcome to bring friends. Children are welcome at this event
 !\n\n**Reminder - Touch is always optional** at these events**.** Come as 
 you are\, wear comfy clothes\, and let your nervous system breathe in the 
 fresh air.\n\nfinding us- Park in the parking lot and walk down the hill t
 o the amphitheater. We will try to find a space in the 2nd or 3rd row.\n\n
 Set a decade after Dorothy’s defeat of the Wicked Witch of the West and 
 her subsequent departure\, The Hope of Oz brings us to a newly invigorated
  Capital where the Wizard’s power has grown immensely with constant syst
 ematic oppression on his denizens and waging a drug-fueled war with the ne
 w cadre of Witches that brings its citizens to their knees. The story foll
 ows Gale\, an investigative “Witch-hunter\,” on the trail of East’s 
 assassination. Trapped in a bar with a synthetic (known as mimics)\, surro
 unded by encroaching revolutionaries\, Witches\, and the Wizard’s ever w
 atchful eyes\, Gale must survive the night if Oz will see its dawn. But in
  an empire of extremes\, who can survive?\n\nIf there is heavy RAIN - We w
 ill cancel this event.
